Subject: Declare all positioned imports for an older read-only native SDK

Reproduced with x86 mainline SDK 74a2d80: pread/pread64 are neither declared
nor exported by its import archive. Match PR1799 public unistd.h signatures;
retain the existing posixc revision guard and generate private import stubs.
Base: PR1800 2eb81b4. Original John KNIPPER, APL 1.1; adaptation AROS
contributors, APL 1.1. Runtime still UNTESTED; no seek fallback.

--- a/tools/crosstools/rust/unmodified/fs/positioned.c
+++ b/tools/crosstools/rust/unmodified/fs/positioned.c
@@ -13,6 +13,8 @@
 
 /* These declarations also allow a read-only 0.40 SDK plus privately generated
    0.41 import stubs. Signatures match the native public unistd.h. */
+extern ssize_t pread(int, void *, size_t, off_t);
+extern ssize_t pread64(int, void *, size_t, __off64_t);
 extern ssize_t pwrite(int, const void *, size_t, off_t);
 extern ssize_t pwrite64(int, const void *, size_t, __off64_t);
 
